# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values. .env.local is gitignored.

# Free Web3Forms access key — powers the LOD-guide email capture. Get one at
# https://web3forms.com/ (enter an email, no account/password needed, key arrives instantly).
# Without this set, the email-capture form falls back to a plain mailto link.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
